#. +> future stable
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionaddheader.cpp:127
msgid "The addheader action adds a header field to the existing message header."
msgstr "De Akschoon \"addheader\" föögt den vörhannen Narichtenkopp en nieg Koppreeg to."

#. +> future stable
