msgid "The \"convert\" action specifies that all body parts with a media type equal to \"media-type\" be converted to the media type in \"media-type\" using conversion parameters."
msgstr "DeBefehl \"convert\" gifft dat an, all Hööftdeel-Parten mit den Medientyp \"media-type\" schöölt mit de Parameters na den Medientyp \"media-type\" ümwannelt warrn."

#. +> future stable
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactiondeleteheader.cpp:35
msgid "Delete header"
msgstr "Koppreeg wegdoon"

#. +> future stable
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactiondeleteheader.cpp:131
msgid "By default, the deleteheader action deletes all occurrences of the named header field."
msgstr "Standardwies deit de Akschoon \"deleteheader\" all Koppregen mit den angeven Naam weg."

#. +> future stable
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactiondiscard.cpp:24
msgid "Discard"
msgstr "Wegsmieten"

#. +> future stable
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactiondiscard.cpp:40
msgid "Discard is used to silently throw away the message."
msgstr "Mit \"discard\" kannst Du en Naricht still un liesen wegdoon."

